# Build context is the repo root (see Dockerfile); BuildKit reads this file next to the Dockerfile.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.expo
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
apps/api/generated
apps/mobile
.git
.secrets
.claude
backlog
# @zivali/tokens builds from docs/design/tokens.json; nothing else under docs/ is needed.
docs/**
!docs/design/tokens.json
